    },
    {
      "id": "c03",
      "title": "没有寄出的信",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "归来",
      "text": "这三封信原本要寄去三个地方：旧屋、车站，还有报馆。后来我才知道，同一段往事，也可以有三种不同的讲法。",
      "character": "qiao",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "c04",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        602,
        32
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c04",
      "title": "迟到的解释",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "归来",
      "text": "我离开的那天，雨比今天还大。不是所有沉默都意味着忘记，有些时候，一个人只是还没找到能让对方听明白的话。",
      "character": "lin",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "c05",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        887,
        32
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "slide",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c05",
      "title": "折痕",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "归来",
      "text": "你看，这里折过两次。我一直没有打开最后一页。我想，若是你回来，应该由你决定这封信要留在哪里。",
      "character": "qiao",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "c06",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        1172,
        32
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c06",
      "title": "留下这封信吗",
      "kind": "choice",
      "chapter": "归来",
      "text": "在离开码头之前，先决定是否收下这封旧信。它会成为这次归来里一件可以带走、也可以留下的东西。",
      "character": "qiao",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": null,
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "收下旧信，认真保管。",
          "target": "c07",
          "set_flag": {
            "flag": "kept_letter",
            "value": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "让信留在旧屋。",
          "target": "c07",
          "set_flag": {
            "flag": "kept_letter",
            "value": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "position": [
        1457,
        32
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": "bell"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07",
      "title": "雨伞之下",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "归来",
      "text": "雨伞只够两个人并肩走，谁也无法装作走在很远的地方。旧友之间有时需要的，恰恰是这样一点无法逃开的距离。",
      "character": "lin",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "c08",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        32,
        212
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c08",
      "title": "灯重新亮了",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "归来",
      "text": "旧屋的灯还亮着。有人说，只要灯还亮着，回来就不算太迟。但灯也会熄灭，我们需要在那之前把话说清。",
      "character": "qiao",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "c09",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        317,
        212
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [
        {
          "character": "lin",
          "expression": "平静",
          "side": "left",
          "scale": 0.9
        }
      ],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c09",
      "title": "第三封信",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "归来",
      "text": "寄往报馆的信里提到了一件没有登报的小事。它改变了几个人的去向，却从未出现在那些漂亮的告别词里。",
      "character": "qiao",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "c10",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        602,
        212
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c10",
      "title": "是否追问",
      "kind": "choice",
      "chapter": "归来",
      "text": "你可以问清报馆那封信的来由，也可以先照顾眼前的人。选择追问会打开第三条路线；沉默仍能通向另外两个结局。",
      "character": "qiao",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": null,
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "问清第三封信的真相。",
          "target": "c11",
          "set_flag": {
            "flag": "asked_truth",
            "value": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "此刻先陪她走完这段路。",
          "target": "c11",
          "set_flag": {
            "flag": "asked_truth",
            "value": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "position": [
        887,
        212
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": "bell"
    },
    {
      "id": "c11",
      "title": "三种明天",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "归来",
      "text": "有人选择留下，有人选择远行，也有人想在出发以前找到真相。我们不必替彼此决定，但必须为自己的选择负责。",
      "character": "lin",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "c12",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        1172,
        212
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c12",
      "title": "决定去向",
      "kind": "choice",
      "chapter": "归来",
      "text": "雨正在变小。旧屋的门、最后一班列车，还有报馆清晨的第一盏灯，都在等待一个回答。",
      "character": "qiao",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": null,
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "留下来，把旧屋的窗重新打开。",
          "target": "a01"
        },
        {
          "text": "去车站，好好告别后出发。",
          "target": "b01"
        },
        {
          "text": "去报馆，让被省略的事情留下记录。",
          "target": "d01",
          "condition": {
            "flag": "asked_truth",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "position": [
        1457,
