      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a02",
      "title": "擦去灰尘",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "留下",
      "text": "他们花了一整个下午擦窗，水盆换了三次。许多原本以为非说不可的话，就在递抹布的时候慢慢说完了。",
      "character": "lin",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "a03",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        317,
        392
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a03",
      "title": "晚餐",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "留下",
      "text": "两份简单的晚餐，一盏不太亮的灯。生活不会因为一次归来就变得容易，但至少有人愿意一起商量明天。",
      "character": "qiao",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "a04",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        602,
        392
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [
        {
          "character": "lin",
          "expression": "平静",
          "side": "left",
          "scale": 0.9
        }
      ],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a04",
      "title": "修好的栏杆",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "留下",
      "text": "码头的工人说，那一角栏杆其实很好修，只是一直没人报修。有些缺口也是如此，要先承认它还在。",
      "character": "lin",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "a05",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        887,
        392
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "slide",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a05",
      "title": "把话说完",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "留下",
      "text": "我不想把留下当作补偿。你可以改变主意，也可以有自己的工作和朋友。我希望我们都是愿意留在这里的人。",
      "character": "qiao",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "a06",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        1172,
        392
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a06",
      "title": "信的位置",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "留下",
      "text": "旧信放进了抽屉，也有一些话被重新写在纸上。过去得到一个位置，就不必再占据所有的明天。",
      "character": "lin",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "a07",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        1457,
        392
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a07",
      "title": "约定的尺度",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "留下",
      "text": "他们没有承诺永远，只约好在离开之前提前说，在难过的时候不让沉默替自己回答。",
      "character": "qiao",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "a08",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        32,
        572
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a08",
      "title": "第一个晴天",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "留下",
      "text": "清晨的阳光照过洗净的窗。海面没有发生什么奇迹，屋里的人却终于能把早餐吃完。",
      "character": "lin",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "a09",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        317,
        572
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a09",
      "title": "还会下雨",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "留下",
      "text": "天气预报说，周末还会有雨。他们把两把雨伞放在门边，谁也没有因此觉得这个晴天不值得珍惜。",
      "character": "qiao",
      "background": "bay",
      "next": "a10",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        602,
        572
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a10",
      "title": "结局：晴天的约定",
      "kind": "ending",
      "chapter": "留下",
      "text": "旧屋没有变成永不散场的舞会，只成为可以认真生活的地方。他们学着在同一个屋檐下保持各自的自由，也学着把想说的话说在来得及的时候。\n\n留下，不是重演过去，而是一起安排一个新的明天。",
      "character": null,
      "background": "bay",
      "next": null,
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        887,
        572
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": null,
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b01",
      "title": "买票",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "远行",
      "text": "售票员问，是单程还是往返。他想了想，买下了一张单程票。告别的诚意，不需要用一张尚未决定日期的回程票证明。",
      "character": "qiao",
      "background": "city",
      "next": "b02",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        1172,
        572
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "fade",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b02",
      "title": "站台",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "远行",
      "text": "站台上的人不多，行李碰撞木地板的声音却格外清楚。他们终于有时间把那一次匆忙的离开重新说一遍。",
      "character": "lin",
      "background": "city",
      "next": "b03",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        1457,
        572
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b03",
      "title": "把误会归还",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "远行",
      "text": "原来那些被当作冷漠的片段，也包含过犹豫和害怕。知道这些不能让一切恢复原样，却能让人不再一直责怪自己。",
      "character": "qiao",
      "background": "city",
      "next": "b04",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        32,
        752
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b04",
      "title": "各自的路",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "远行",
      "text": "你不需要为了证明我重要而放弃出发。你曾在这里认真生活过，这件事不会被一张车票擦掉。",
      "character": "lin",
      "background": "city",
      "next": "b05",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        317,
        752
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "slide",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b05",
      "title": "等待发车",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "远行",
      "text": "他们坐在长椅的两端，分享一袋已经有点凉的面包。没有谁再试图把这十分钟延长成一生。",
      "character": "qiao",
      "background": "city",
      "next": "b06",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        602,
        752
      ],
      "portrait_side": "right",
      "portrait_scale": 1.0,
      "expression": "平静",
      "actors": [],
      "transition": "none",
      "bgm": null,
      "sound": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b06",
      "title": "新的地址",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "远行",
      "text": "林澈把新地址写在纸上。不是保证每一封信都会得到及时回复，而是让彼此在愿意的时候，仍能找到一个可以寄信的地方。",
      "character": "lin",
      "background": "city",
      "next": "b07",
      "choices": [],
      "position": [
        887,
        752
